<http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/ont/dul/DUL.owl#Collection> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Any container for entities that share one or more common properties. E.g. \"stone objects\", \"the nurses\", \"the Louvre Aegyptian collection\", all the elections for the Italian President of the Republic. A collection is not a logical class: a collection is a first-order entity, while a class is second-order. A collection is neither an aggregate of its member entities (see e.g. ObjectAggregate class)." .
