<http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/InformationContentExpressedAsALogarithmToBase10> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "I(xi) as the information content I(xi) of a result xi (e.g. the occurrence of a character xi) is the common logarithm of the reciprocal of the probability p(xi) of its occurrence, i.e.: l(x) lg 1/p(x) Hart, where p(x) is the probability of the event x"@en .
